<title>SWITZERLAND: Swiss Nov producer/import prices fall 2.5 pct y/y.</title>
<headline>Swiss Nov producer/import prices fall 2.5 pct y/y.</headline>
<dateline>BERNE 1996-12-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The combined index for Swiss producer and import prices fell 0.4 percent in November to stand 2.5 percent lower than a year earlier, the Federal Statistics Office said.  </p>
<p>				    Nov 1996   Oct 1996   Nov 1995</p>
<p>Monthly pct index change     - 0.4	+ 0.1	- 0.5</p>
<p>Yr/yr pct index change	 - 2.5	- 2.5	- 1.0</p>
<p>Index (100 = May 1993)	  96.4	 96.8	 98.8</p>
<p>Note - The combined producer/import price index replaced the wholesale price index in May 1993.  </p>
<p>It said producer prices dropped 0.3 percent in the month and 2.0 percent from November 1995, while import prices slipped 0.8 percent monthly and 3.6 percent year-on-year.</p>
<p>-- Zurich newsroom +41 1 631 7340</p>
